00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:28.969
<v David Whitfield>Lovely. We've accidentally made a drying oven with desks in it.</v>

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:38.149
<v David Whitfield>And the broken coffee machine in the canteen is still ruining my morning. That's also a moan, not me volunteering to mend it.</v>

00:00:40.090 --> 00:00:45.340
<v Jamie Brennan>You'd make it worse, Dave. We'd get hydraulic oil out of the hot chocolate button.</v>

00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:52.350
<v Sarah Okafor>Right, before this becomes a catering meeting. Closed bits first, then what's actually being picked up.</v>

00:00:54.570 --> 00:01:01.920
<v Aisha Begum>Yeah so, I signed off the inspection on the booster pump on Tuesday. That's finished, not something I'm carrying into today.</v>

00:01:03.130 --> 00:01:06.280
