<v Aisha Begum>Last Tuesday, yeah. Sorry, still got last week's dates in my head.</v>

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:20.340
<v Sarah Okafor>Same here. I signed off the inspection on the main isolation valve on Tuesday as well. That's closed.</v>

00:01:20.659 --> 00:01:26.959
