00:03:11.949 --> 00:03:16.150
<v Aisha Begum>Yeah, I'll sort the training records for the new starters next Tuesday.</v>

00:03:16.680 --> 00:03:20.180
<v Jamie Brennan>Nothing says welcome to the factory like a training record.</v>

00:03:20.680 --> 00:03:23.830
<v Aisha Begum>Better than welcoming them with whatever Dave's calling coffee.</v>

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:29.550
<v Sarah Okafor>Tom, can you send the shift handover report round by the end of the week?</v>

00:03:31.120 --> 00:03:36.020
<v Tomasz Nowak>Yeah, I'll send the shift handover report round by the end of the week.</v>

00:03:37.229 --> 00:03:42.479
