00:04:21.579 --> 00:04:27.529
<v Aisha Begum>Yeah, um, permit to work and isolation only — we're not rolling any physical repair into that?</v>

00:04:29.220 --> 00:04:33.069
<v Sarah Okafor>Correct. Just the permit to work and isolation for the AC1.</v>

00:04:34.279 --> 00:04:41.279
<v Aisha Begum>Okay, I'll sort the permit to work and isolation for the AC1. Understood that it matters but it's not urgent.</v>

00:04:41.879 --> 00:04:47.829
<v Tomasz Nowak>Right, that's the bit I needed straight. I heard AC1 and thought we'd jumped onto maintenance work.</v>

00:04:48.829 --> 00:04:50.930
<v Sarah Okafor>No, nothing additional being assigned there.</v>

00:04:53.410 --> 00:05:00.759
<v Sarah Okafor>Hannah Price, can you do the pre-use checks on the FLTs this afternoon? Not an emergency but don't let it slip.</v>

00:05:02.149 --> 00:05:10.199
<v Hannah Price>Yes, I'll do the pre-use checks on the FLTs this afternoon. Got the priority — not an emergency but don't let it slip.</v>

00:05:10.930 --> 00:05:14.779
<v Marcus Hale>Sorry, tiny bit of lag. You said pre-use checks this afternoon?</v>

00:05:15.560 --> 00:05:19.410
<v Hannah Price>That's right. Pre-use, not a check after they've already been used.</v>

00:05:21.769 --> 00:05:22.970
<v Sarah Okafor>Yeah, exactly. Cheers.</v>

