00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:55.540
<v Sarah Okafor>Understood, Jamie. Chasing the purchase order for the line two, not guaranteeing approval.</v>

00:05:57.000 --> 00:06:04.699
<v Hannah Price>And I'll inspect the Boiler Safety Relief Valve for leaks by the end of the week. It matters but it's not urgent.</v>

00:06:06.180 --> 00:06:10.029
<v Marcus Hale>That's an inspection for leaks, yeah? Not taking the valve apart?</v>

00:06:11.040 --> 00:06:13.839
<v Hannah Price>Yeah, inspection for leaks only. No strip-down included.</v>

00:06:15.350 --> 00:06:20.600
<v Sarah Okafor>Thanks, Hannah Price. Boiler Safety Relief Valve inspection by the end of the week, then.</v>

00:06:22.720 --> 00:06:28.319
